    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0792" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg782"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Marshall to Colonel Marshall S. Carter </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-08-11">11 August 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1293. Delivery should not be completed reference 96621<anchor n="21"
                        xml:id="d471-f1"/> at this time, on the 8–⅓ Air Group Program through
                    surplus property channels. Just how long delivery should be delayed I am not
                    prepared to state at this time.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d471-f1" n="21" xml:id="d471-f1-content">
